# Kutzil's Flanker, first mode: only creatures that left "under your control this turn" count. Bot1's own Ornithopter
# died on turn 1 (an earlier turn: not counted); on turn 2 Bot1 Bolts Bot2's Ornithopter (a creature that left under
# Bot2's control: not counted) and sacrifices Black Lotus (not a creature), then flashes in the Flanker: no counters,
# a 3/1. The positive control, a creature of Bot1's leaving in the same turn, is the neighbouring scenario.

